      "text": "Nephi1 makes record with own hand, 1 Ne. 1:3. Nephi1 stretches hand unto brethren, and the Lord shakes them, 1 Ne. 17:54. worship the Father in Christ’s name with pure hearts and clean hands, 2 Ne. 25:16. can ye look up to God with pure heart and clean hands, Alma 5:19. kingdom of heaven is soon at hand, Alma 5:28, 50 (10:20; Hel. 5:32). Christ invites Nephites to thrust hands into his side, feel nail prints in hands and feet, 3 Ne. 11:14–15.",
